- What do you mean?

5
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,900
(Penny:)Oh!

6
00:00:22,906 --> 00:00:24,166
(Penny:)- Wow!
- Mm-hm.

7
00:00:24,641 --> 00:00:27,341
(Leonard:)The holographic principle suggests...

8
00:00:27,544 --> 00:00:30,574
(Leonard:)...that what we all experience every day
