10
00:00:35,786 --> 00:00:41,726
(Leonard:)...on a surface located
at the farthest reaches of our cosmos.

11
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:46,660
(Leonard:)So it's possible that our lives
are really just...

12
00:00:47,431 --> 00:00:51,661
